# Example of RayFish for coherent point sources

We demonstrate the ability of RayFish on the example of estimating the distance between two point sources in x- and z-dimensions.

The estimation error depends on the relative phase between the two point sources.


## visualize_qfi
The notebook `visualize_qfi` contains the necessary execution block to obtain the results. Below there's the plot with the results.

